si quieres lavarte.
77
00:16:18.608 --> 00:16:20.401
Creo que le tomaré la palabra.
78
00:16:21.616 --> 00:16:22.909
Le agradezco.
79
00:16:28.891 --> 00:16:31.442
Тийм ээ!
80
00:16:31.741 --> 00:16:33.950
